            "title": "Question: Square brackets",
            "id": 79838,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir listedeki <code>[ ]</code> köşeli parantezler nereye konur?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Listedeki tüm değerlerin etrafına</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Listedeki değerlerden önce</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Listedeki her değerin etrafında</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Listedeki tüm değerlerin etrafına.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"Lima\"</code> ve <code>\"Oslo\"</code> içeren tek bir listeye ihtiyacın var. Parantezler hangi atamada doğru yerdedir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>cities = [\"Lima\", \"Oslo\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>cities = [\"Lima\"], [\"Oslo\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>cities = [\"Lima\", \"Oslo\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>cities = [\"Lima\", \"Oslo\"]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Any number",
            "id": 79796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu listede kaç değer var?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cats = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;whiskers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cats)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['whiskers', 'tom']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İki</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sıfır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İki öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atama <code>cats</code> değişkeninde ne depolar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cats = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;whiskers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cats)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['whiskers', 'tom']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İki string değeri içeren tek bir liste</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Birleştirilmiş tek bir string içeren tek bir liste</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">String'ler tırnak içinde olduğu için boş bir liste</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İki string değeri içeren tek bir liste.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Square brackets",
            "id": 79834,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"classic\"</code> ve <code>\"dark mode\"</code> değerlerini depolayan bir liste oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(themes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['classic', 'dark mode']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>,</code> ve son olarak <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>['classic', 'dark mode']</code> yazdıracak şekilde <code>\"classic\"</code> ve <code>\"dark mode\"</code> değerlerini depolayan bir liste oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(themes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['classic', 'dark mode']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>,</code> ve son olarak <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Empty list",
