            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>plans</code>'e boş bir liste atamak için köşeli parantezleri <code>[ ]</code> kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"plans = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(plans)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"10\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[]</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
