          {
            "title": "Question: Access element",
            "id": 79467,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu listenin ilk öğesine nasıl erişiriz?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"test_scores = [\" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>test_scores[0]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>test_scores[1]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>test_scores[90]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>test_scores[0]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>test_scores.pop(0)</code> çalıştırdıktan sonra listedeki <code>85</code> değerini hangi ifade getirir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"test_scores = [\" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">test_scores[0]</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">test_scores[1]</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">test_scores[85]</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">test_scores[0] öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
