            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Son dondurma aromasını <code>\"strawberry\"</code> olarak güncellemek için <code>2</code> indeksini kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"flavors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;pistachio&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"flavors[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;strawberry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(flavors)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['vanilla', 'chocolate', 'strawberry']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>2</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
