            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.append(3)</code> kodunu yazarak listenin sonuna <code>3</code> ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"trading_values = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"trading_values.append(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(trading_values)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"48\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>.append(3)</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
